{"ts":"2026-10-10T10:02:11.693Z","type":"agent_event","event":{"type":"content_end","contentType":"reasoning","reasoning":"I realize \"openai-compatible\" is a provider id, so I should do a quick live probe before the full build, loading the API key from .env.local via Node's env-file flag. I need to be careful about whether that flag overrides an already-set empty CLINE_MODEL variable in this shell.\n\nFor the probe itself, I'll write a temporary `.cline-probe.mjs` file in the repo root rather than a .ts file, since tsconfig only picks up TypeScript files, and I'll delete it once I'm done testing.\n\nI've confirmed the SDK API shape (Agent config, subscribe/run, createTool with zod). Now I'll run a quick scratch probe using openai-compatible against the Cline API to verify tool calling works, then delete the probe file—without ever printing the key.\n\n"}}
