ave / publish / reject.\n4. **`server/ai.ts`:** gets `runToolAgent`, so the model calls still go through one module. It builds the `@cline/sdk` Agent, logs model / prompt version / input hash, retries once, then falls back to `{ error }`.\n5. **`server/agents/ruleMaintenance.ts`:** the 5 tools (zod inputs;"}}
