k` lazily (dynamic import) inside the real agent factory; `ruleMaintenance.ts` imports `createTool` statically (cold import ≈ 1.4 s, only on admin routes).\n+53: - Live timing with `anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5`: Orunodoi notice ≈ 21 s (6 tool calls), IGNOAPS new scheme ≈ 30–60 s. Longer than the tool timeout here, so run `scripts/agent-smoke.mjs` in the background with a log.\n+54: \n+55: ## T3 storage\n+56: - `node:sqlite` works inside Next 16 route handlers and Vitest (no build trouble). DB file: `KAAGAZ_DB_PATH` or `data/kaagaz.db` (`/data/` is git-ignored). Vitest sets `KAAGAZ_DB_PATH=:memory:` (vitest.config.mts), so tests never touch `data/`.\n+57: - A page that reads the DB/registry per request needs `await connection()` inside a `<Suspense>` child (Cache Components). `connection()` throws outside a Next request scope, so unit tests call the handler (`handleList`) instead of the route.\n+58: - `cmd /c \"x & echo %ERRORLEVEL%\"` expands ERRORLEVEL too early (prints empty). Use `cmd /c \"npm test >nul 2>&1\"; $LASTEXITCODE` in PowerShell.\n+59: \n```","success":true},"durationMs":7}}
