ce. Otherwise it must be `provisional`, so the engine says needs_verification. `saveProposal` is refused unless every new and regression test passes. `publish` re-runs all checks (a stale proposal cannot go live).\n+11: - Regression tests = built-in suites (`schemes/regression.ts`, the \"version 1\" tests) + the tests of every published version of that scheme.\n+12: - The agent edits existing schemes with a JSON merge patch (`mergePatch.ts`, RFC 7386) instead of re-sending the whole rule (fewer tokens, faster demo).\n+13: - `ai.ts` also hosts `runToolAgent` (the agent path), so there is still one model module: it logs model / promptVersion / inputHash / toolCalls, retries once only if no tool ran yet, falls back to `{ error }`, and never throws.\n+14: - Store = `node:sqlite` file (`KAAGAZ_DB_PATH` or `data/kaagaz.db`). `rule_versions` has extra `notice` and `summary` columns (needed to re-check provenance at publish time and to show the reviewer a summary). A unique partial index allows one published row per scheme+version.\n+15: - `/` and `/admin` render per request (`connection()` inside `<Suspense>`); every request calls `syncRegistry()` (idempotent), so versions published by any process appear immediately.\n+16: - `/admin` is English-only (for maintainers, not citizens). There is no auth on `/admin`; see Requests for Claude in LOG.md.\n+17: \n+18: ## Previous state (after T2)\n```","success":true},"durationMs":3}}
{"ts":"2026-10-10T11:19:23.046Z","type":"agent_event","event":{"type":"content_start","contentType":"tool","toolName":"editor","toolCallId":"toolu_01LmE8Yxbjib2JDF1SHFJ7gf","input":{"path":"C:\\Dev\\cline hackathon\\build\\memory-bank\\activeContext.md","old_text":"## Next step\nT3: Rule Maintenance Agent (`@cline/sdk`, `node:sqlite` `rule_versions`, regression tests + human approval, versioned packs). Before the demo: a phone click-through of the T2 flow and native-speaker review of `src/i18n.ts`.","new_text":"## Next step\nT4: rejection decoder + polish. Before the demo: a phone click-through of `/` and `/admin`, native-speaker review of `src/i18n.ts` and of the Assamese text the agent writes, and a decision on protecting `/admin`."}}}
