module that talks to a model.\n+23: - `src/server/adminApi.ts` + `src/app/api/admin/rules/**` (T3): propose (NDJSON stream), list (history + diff), `[id]/publish`, `[id]/reject`. `src/app/admin/` is the maintainer UI.\n```","success":true},"durationMs":2}}
